    "perplexity": {
      "description": "Puzzles Like You is the fifth and final studio album by Mojave 3, released in 2006 on 4AD. It marked a noticeable shift from the band’s earlier hushed, dreamier sound toward a brighter, more uptempo style built around jangly guitars, melodic pop hooks, and a lighter, more immediate feel.\n\nThe album’s songs balance breezy, almost sunlit indie-pop with the group’s familiar melancholy, so the record still feels distinctly Mojave 3 even as it moves closer to classic power-pop and Americana-tinged rock. Tracks such as “Truck Driving Man,” “Breaking the Ice,” and the title track helped define its reputation as one of the band’s most accessible releases, and it was generally met with fair-to-positive reviews on release.",
